{"id":51199,"date":"2026-05-12T07:18:13","date_gmt":"2026-05-12T06:18:13","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=51199"},"modified":"2026-08-23T18:14:09","modified_gmt":"2026-08-23T17:14:09","slug":"grande-premio-de-santo-antonio","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/grande-premio-de-santo-antonio\/","title":{"rendered":"Grande Pr\u00e9mio de Santo Ant\u00f3nio 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: GRANDE PR\u00c9MIO DE SANTO ANT\u00d3NIO TORRES NOVAS --><\/p>\n<div  style=\"max-width: 1140px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px 16px 60px 16px; box-sizing: border-box; overflow-x: hidden;\"><!-- M\u00d3DULO 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<section  style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 24px; backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\">\n<h2 style=\"font-size: clamp(20px, 4vw, 26px); font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin: 0 0 16px 0;\">\n      Sobre o <span  style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Grande Pr\u00e9mio de Santo Ant\u00f3nio (Torres Novas)<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #E2E8F0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 14px 0;\">\n      O <strong>Grande Pr\u00e9mio de Santo Ant\u00f3nio<\/strong> \u00e9 uma das corridas mais tradicionais do Ribatejo, organizada pela Uni\u00e3o Desportiva e Recreativa da Zona Alta (UDRZA) em Torres Novas. Com dezenas de edi\u00e7\u00f5es realizadas, a prova re\u00fane atletas de elite e amadores num circuito urbano desafiante.\n    <\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #E2E8F0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">\n      O evento inclui provas de atletismo para todos os escal\u00f5es et\u00e1rios (jovens, seniores e veteranos) e uma caminhada aberta \u00e0 popula\u00e7\u00e3o. Planeie a sua estrat\u00e9gia de corrida com a nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\" target=\"_blank\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a> e prepare a sua participa\u00e7\u00e3o na \u00e9poca de atletismo da <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/meia-maratona-lisboa\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\" target=\"_blank\">regi\u00e3o centro e Ribatejo<\/a>.\n    <\/p>\n<\/section>\n<p><!-- M\u00d3DULO 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<section  style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #C4B5FD; margin: 0 0 16px 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n      \u26a1 Ficha T\u00e9cnica do Evento<br \/>\n    <\/h3>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 16px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); padding: 14px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\"><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase;\">\ud83d\udcc5 Data Prevista<\/span><\/p>\n<div style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 2px;\">Junho de 2027<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); padding: 14px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\"><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase;\">\ud83d\udccd Localiza\u00e7\u00e3o<\/span><\/p>\n<div style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 2px;\">Torres Novas, Santar\u00e9m<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); padding: 14px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\"><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Entidade<\/span><\/p>\n<div style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 2px;\">UDR Zona Alta<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); padding: 14px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\"><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase;\">\ud83d\udee3\ufe0f Tipo de Piso<\/span><\/p>\n<div style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 2px;\">Asfalto Urbano<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/section>\n<p><!-- M\u00d3DULO 3: GEOMETRIA DA PROVA & PERCURSO --><\/p>\n<section  style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin: 0 0 14px 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n      \ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f Geometria da Prova &#038; Percurso<br \/>\n    <\/h3>\n<p style=\"color: #E2E8F0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 12px 0;\">\n      O circuito urbano desenrola-se pelas ruas principais da freguesia e centro de Torres Novas, apresentando um perfil maioritariamente plano com pequenas ondula\u00e7\u00f5es de relevo que testam a resist\u00eancia dos atletas nos momentos de mudan\u00e7a de ritmo.\n    <\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #E2E8F0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">\n      A vasta presen\u00e7a de p\u00fablico ao longo das art\u00e9rias da cidade cria uma atmosfera envolvente e motivadora para os corredores de todas as categorias.\n    <\/p>\n<\/section>\n<p><!-- M\u00d3DULO 4: BANNER DA CALCULADORA DE PACE --><\/p>\n<section  style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15) 0%, rgba(109, 40, 217, 0.15) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 24px; text-align: center;\">\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin: 0 0 8px 0;\">\u23f1\ufe0f Calcula o teu Ritmo de Corrida em Torres Novas<\/h3>\n<p style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 0 16px 0;\">Define os teus ritmos-alvo por quil\u00f3metro para atingir a melhor marca no Grande Pr\u00e9mio.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8B5CF6 0%, #6D28D9 100%); color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 800; border-radius: 20px; padding: 0 24px; height: 42px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 13px;\"><br \/>\n      Calcular Pace de Corrida \u2197<br \/>\n    <\/a><\/section>\n<p><!-- M\u00d3DULO 5: ONDE FICAR --><\/p>\n<section  style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin: 0 0 14px 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n      \ud83c\udfe8 Onde Ficar (Alojamento em Torres Novas)<br \/>\n    <\/h3>\n<p style=\"color: #E2E8F0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">\n      Para atletas e fam\u00edlias que viajam para participar na prova, recomenda-se a reserva de unidades hoteleiras ou alojamento local no centro hist\u00f3rico de Torres Novas ou na vizinha cidade de Entroncamento.\n    <\/p>\n<\/section>\n<p><!-- M\u00d3DULO 6: SOBRE O LOCAL & GASTRONOMIA --><\/p>\n<section  style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin: 0 0 14px 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n      \ud83c\udf0d Sobre Torres Novas &#038; Gastronomia Regional<br \/>\n    <\/h3>\n<p style=\"color: #E2E8F0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">\n      Torres Novas \u00e9 uma cidade ribatejana rica em patrim\u00f3nio hist\u00f3rico, destacando-se o seu Castelo medieval e a reserva natural do Paul do Boquilobo. No p\u00f3s-prova, aproveite para saborear as especialidades gastron\u00f3micas regionais como o frango assado \u00e0 passarinho, as migas ribatejanas e a do\u00e7aria com figo preto.\n    <\/p>\n<\/section>\n<p><!-- M\u00d3DULO 7: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<section  style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px;\">\n<h2  style=\"font-size: clamp(20px, 4vw, 24px); font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin: 0 0 16px 0;\">\n      Perguntas <span  style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes<\/span><\/h2>\n<div  style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;\">\n<details  style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.4); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 18px;\">\n<summary  style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #FFFFFF; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px;\">Onde posso consultar os Resultados do Grande Pr\u00e9mio de Santo Ant\u00f3nio?<\/summary>\n<div  style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 10px; line-height: 1.5;\">\n          Os resultados oficiais e classifica\u00e7\u00f5es por escal\u00e3o s\u00e3o homologados pela UDR Zona Alta e disponibilizados no portal Portugal Running.\n        <\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details  style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.4); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 18px;\">\n<summary  style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #FFFFFF; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px;\">Quem organiza o evento?<\/summary>\n<div  style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 10px; line-height: 1.5;\">\n          A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo da Uni\u00e3o Desportiva e Recreativa da Zona Alta (UDRZA) em parceria com as entidades locais de Torres Novas.\n        <\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<\/section>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- FIM BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: GRANDE PR\u00c9MIO DE SANTO ANT\u00d3NIO TORRES NOVAS --><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":51200,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"elementor_header_footer","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,28,624],"event_type_2":[727,820,39],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-51199","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-torres-novas-santarem","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type-kids","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_2-santarem"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/1778415532-1.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/51199","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=51199"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/51199\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":61360,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/51199\/revisions\/61360"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/51200"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=51199"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=51199"},{"taxon